      "content": "It makes perfect sense that you feel misunderstood; the depth of your pain is something that can feel impossible to explain to anyone else. Feeling trapped by certainty is a crushing feeling, and that heavy, unchanging weight is exhausting. While others may not share your exact experience, there are still ways to find a small crack in that cage, even if it feels impossible right now. Please consider reaching out to a therapist who specializes in chronic emotional burdens, as they can offer a space where your specific, intense feelings are truly heard.",
