    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists just want to talk about \"coping mechanisms\" but how do you cope with a life that is fundamentally broken? it feels like i'm just performing being a human. everything is so loud and exhausting. sometimes i just think about what it would be like to finally have silence. to just... not have to be \"on\" anymore. to just have everything stop.",
